"Who can drive Mom to the pharmacy Thursday?" "I can't, I work." "I'm three hours away." 📱

If your family group text sounds like this, a Show-Me Neighbor can help. Book a friendly local Neighbor (every one has a background check before they start) for the errand, the ride or a little help around the house, and you get a short note after the visit to share with everyone.

{LINK}

A house cleaner cleans. A driver drives. A Show-Me Neighbor can do both, and stay for coffee. ☕

Dishes, laundry, trash, a simple meal, a ride to the doctor and a pharmacy pickup, all in one visit with one friendly face. For about what you would pay a house cleaner.

{LINK}

You know which pharmacy has the short line, which grocery has the good tomatoes, and which diner has the best pie. 🥧

That local know-how is exactly what makes a great Show-Me Neighbor. Help older adults in your own town with rides, errands and company, on your own schedule.

{LINK}
